# The Shopify GitHub integration syncs this WHOLE branch as the theme and
# enforces a 50MB limit, so the heavy things stay off it: the 123MB of source
# and retouched product photography, and the intermediate image directories.
#
# The small text artefacts do NOT stay off it. They used to live only on the
# 'catalogue' branch, which meant every `git checkout main` deleted them from
# disk — the price sheet, the import CSVs and the setup checklists would simply
# vanish, and the build scripts silently reverted to an older revision. They are
# a few hundred KB. They live here now.

# --- heavy image working directories (never on any branch) ---
import/images/
_work/clean/
_work/raw/
_work/raw_new/
_work/wa/
_work/sheets/
_work/sheets_clean/
_work/samples/
_work/out/
_work/*.jpg
_work/*.png
_work/*.zip
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# An unzipped copy of the theme ZIP. Committing it would put a second full copy
# of the theme inside the theme.
bob-music-store-theme/
bob-music-store-theme.zip

# --- generated design previews ---
preview-*.html
page-*.html
_work/preview.html
scripts/

# --- local editor / tooling config ---
.claude/

.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
